  "details": "It'd be nice if people (especially DJs) could put down tip jars others could click on and use to donate to that person and support them. Every tip jar would be linked to the person who spawned it, and labelled as such. All transactions would be done using VRC Credits and the Creator Economy. Being able to access a user's Tip Jar through their profile would also be nice, but having a physical tip jar in the world would lead to more impulse donations.",
